  Description: "COMPANION / UNCOMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nQuicksole companions gain
    10% movement and attack speed while at least one Monkey King talent is owned.
    Presence effect; extra copies do not multiply it.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nTeam
    / Bullet travel distance: +2.5%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits
    \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING
    REALM\nA marsh runner carrying news nobody wanted to hear. Jokes gave listeners
    somewhere to put their anger. They travel with people who let them finish a sentence
    without requiring it to be funny.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in combat, gain
    0 gold directly. This is not kill loot and does not count as collecting a coin.\r\n\nNamed
    talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages are not
    multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers scale
    separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: orchard, shoe. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment;
    three equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
